  "referenceNumber": "RUS1636",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State considers that there are reasonable grounds to suspect Nadia Narimanovna Cherkasova is an “involved person” under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 because she has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by (1) working as a director, manager or equivalent of an entity which has been carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely Bank Otkritie Financial Corporation PJSC, which was carrying on business in the Russian financial services sector; (2) working as a director, manager or equivalent of a Government of Russia-affiliated entity, namely Bank Otkritie Financial Corporation PJSC. \n",
